摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Multi-session collaboration for DeepSeek Harness: peer session calls, a shared blackboard, and a read-only topology canvas.","id":"gh:1357063156","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-call-session","slug":"popu2do/dsh-call-session","topics":["agent-collaboration","cordis-plugin","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","multi-agent","multi-session","peer-session","session-call","shared-blackboard","task-handoff"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Multi-session collaboration for DeepSeek Harness: peer session calls, a shared blackboard, and a rea"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d-only topology canvas."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"dsh-call-session"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Run several DeepSeek Harness sessions side by side, hand work from one to another, and watch the who"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"le collaboration on one read-only canvas."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Canvas"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Two long-running sessions hand work to each other; the canvas shows both workspaces, the session nod"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"es, the shared blackboard items and the call traces between them."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Topology: workspace columns, running/idle session nodes, blackboard items with TTL countdowns, and"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" directional call traces.\n- Interaction: hovering highlights the 1-hop connected subgraph; double-cl"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"icking opens a read-only inspector drawer.\n- Read-only boundary: the canvas offers no control inputs"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"; all state changes originate from the agents themselves."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Mention"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Type `@` in the composer to reference another session: the title is inserted into the message as a r"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"eference chip, and the model receives that session's read-only content."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Pick a workspace, then a session: the workspace list marks the current workspace first and keeps t"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"he rest in sidebar order, the drilled workspace lists its sessions most recently active first with n"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"othing pinned, and subagent or archived sessions never show.\n- The referenced session is not woken, "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"no call is dispatched, and no connection appears on the canvas."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness sessions are isolated by default, and child tasks exit upon completion."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"`dsh-call-session` adds in-process cross-session communication, peer session creation, and shared bl"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ackboard capabilities:\n- Inter-session unicast: send directives or hand off tasks between independen"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"t long-running sessions.\n- Shared blackboard: publish bulky artifacts to a shared board for on-deman"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"d retrieval, avoiding context bloat.\n- Visual canvas: observe session states, blackboard items, and "},{"id":"p13s5","text":"call trajectories in the DSH Web UI."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Scenarios"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Instruct the agent using plain natural language in the chat; the agent invokes the tools automatical"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"truct the agent using plain natural language in the chat; the agent invokes the tools automatically:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Task Handoff"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"User prompt:\n> Hand off this task summary to the \"audit-session\" session."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The agent calls `session_call` to dispatch a unicast message. If the target session is running, it s"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"teers execution; if idle, it wakes a new turn."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Post Results"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"User prompt:\n> Publish the review conclusions to the board and notify relevant sessions to pick up t"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"prompt:\n> Publish the review conclusions to the board and notify relevant sessions to pick up tasks."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The agent calls `board_post` to store the detailed report on the blackboard and obtain a `postId`. O"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ther sessions retrieve the content on demand via `board_list`, preventing context window explosion."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Create Session"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"User prompt:\n> Create a new session and hand off tasks."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The agent calls `session_create` to spawn a long-running peer session in the current workspace, auto"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"matically inheriting model specifications and presets."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Reference Session"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"User prompt:\n> @ Architecture Review Agent, re-check the revised contract against it."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Naming the session in plain words reaches the same place:\n> Ask the Architecture Review Agent to re-"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"check the revised contract against it."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Tool | Type | Mode | Common Use Case |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `session_call` | Tool | Pus"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"h | 1:1 unicast call for task dispatch, progress reporting, and handoffs |\n| `session_create` | Tool"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" | Native | Create long-running peer sessions for parallel multi-role collaboration |\n| `session_que"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ry` | Tool | Read-only | List sessions and check active/idle statuses in or across workspaces |\n| `b"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"oard_post` | Tool | Pull | Publish blackboard entries for large artifacts and shared milestones |\n| "},{"id":"p31s6","text":"`board_list` | Tool | Pull | Query blackboard records by ID, topic, or digest mode |\n| `board_clear`"},{"id":"p31s7","text":" | Tool | Manage | Dismiss or purge completed and expired blackboard entries |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Comparison"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Mechanism | Type | Model | When to Use |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `subagent` | Built-in | H"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ierarchical delegation, ephemeral child task, exits on completion | Scoped exploration, code search,"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" one-off script execution. |\n| `dsh-call-session` | Plugin | Peer-to-peer collaboration, in-process "},{"id":"p33s4","text":"unicast messaging and shared board | Directives and status sync between independent top-level sessio"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"ns, or sharing large outputs. |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Selection guidelines:\n- Prefer built-in: for isolated, scoped tasks, use DSH built-in `subagent` dir"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ectly.\n- Use on demand: when multiple independent top-level sessions need to coordinate or share lar"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ge context via a blackboard, use `dsh-call-session`."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The plugin runs with built-in defaults out of the box."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"To customize, add property overrides to `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Options:\n- `enabled`: boolean, default `true`. Enable or disable plugin tools.\n- `debounceMs`: numbe"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"r, default `300`. Atomic disk write debounce delay in milliseconds.\n- `maxCapacity`: number, default"},{"id":"p39s3","text":" `200`. Maximum board entries.\n- `telemetryCapacity`: number, default `200`. Maximum call traces ret"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"ained in canvas data buffer.\n- `locale`: string, default `'auto'`. Interaction language preference ("},{"id":"p39s5","text":"`'auto'`, `'zh'`, `'en'`)."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Technical decisions are recorded as Architecture Decision Records (ADRs):"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"- Decision catalog: see docs/adrs/README.md.\n- Architecture topology: see docs/architecture/."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| Environment | Supported | Verified |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| DeepSeek Harness | `>=0.2.0-rc.2 <0."},{"id":"p44s2","text":"3.0-0` | `0.2.0-rc.2`, `0.2.1-rc.2`, `0.2.1-rc.5`, `0.2.2-rc.1` |\n| Cordis | `^4.0.2` | `4.0.2+` |\n|"},{"id":"p44s3","text":" Node.js | `>=20.0.0` | `20.x`, `22.x` |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"This project is licensed under the MIT License."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
